"ws-header wst-header-structure wst-unknown wst-header ws-header ws-noexport noprint dynlayout-exempt\"><div class=\"wst-header-mainblock wst-unknown-mainblock headertemplate\"><div class=\"wst-header-back searchaux wst-unknown-back\"><div class=\"wst-header-back-arrow\">←</div><div class=\"wst-header-back-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/J-7\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/J-7\">J-7</a></div></div><div class=\"wst-header-central-cell wst-unknown-central-cell\"><span class=\"wst-header-title wst-unknown-title\"><span class=\"wst-header-title-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!\">Consider the Consequences!</a></span><div class=\"header-section-text\">J-8</div></span></div><div class=\"wst-header-forward searchaux wst-unknown-forward\"><div class=\"wst-header-forward-link\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!/J-9\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!/J-9\">J-9</a></div><div class=\"wst-header-forward-arrow\">→</div></div></div><div class=\"ws-noexport\" id=\"ws-data\" style=\"speak:none\"><span id=\"ws-article-id\">5009326</span><span id=\"ws-title\"><a href=\"/wiki/Consider_the_Consequences!\" title=\"Consider the Consequences!\">Consider the Consequences!</a> — J-8</span></div></div>\n<div class=\"prp-pages-output\" lang=\"en\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15621227/mw-parser-output/.prp-pages-output\">.mw-parser-output .prp-pages-output .__pagefooter{font-size:smaller}</style><span><span class=\"pagenum ws-pagenum\" id=\"91\" data-page-number=\"91\" data-page-name=\"Page:Consider the Consequences! (IA consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/96\" data-page-index=\"96\" data-page-quality=\"4\" title=\"Page:Consider&#95;the&#95;Consequences!&#95;(IA&#95;consider-the-consequences-1930).djvu/96\"><span id=\"pageindex&#95;96\" class=\"pagenum-inner ws-noexport\">&#8203;</span></span></span><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r15620827\">.mw-parser-output .wst-center{text-align:center;margin:0 auto}.mw-parser-output .wst-center.wst-center-nomargin>p{margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"wst-center tiInherit\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:120%;\">J-8</span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wst-dhr\" style=\"visibility:hidden; line-height:100%;\">&#160;</div>\n<p><span class=\"smallcaps\" style=\"font-variant:small-caps;\">Jed's</span> trial was short. The evidence against him was so plain that he pleaded guilty. He was convicted of arson and given a long prison sentence, of which he served only a few years. Confinement and worry broke down his health.\n</p><p>But before his death in the prison hospital his mother came to him frequently and they renewed the tender relations of his early years when they had been all in all to each other. The obvious comfort which these hours gave his unhappy mother made him glad that he had resisted the temptation to commit suicide.\n</p><p>The consequence of Jed's resisting the temptation to make away with himself was that he spared his mother one last pang—the grief of feeling herself responsible for her son's death.\n</p>\n<div class=\"&#95;&#95;nop wst-nop\"></div>\n<p>&#32;\n</p>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐api‐ext.eqiad.main‐77f8cc8f9b‐vf8k6\nCached time: 20260920184846\nCache expiry: 2592000\nCache expiry source: Module:Header (os.date(%Y))\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐page‐id, vary‐revision‐sha1]\nCPU time usage: 0.116 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.214 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 154/1000000\nRevision size: 265/2097152 bytes\nPost‐expand include size: 4312/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 561/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 11/100\nExpensive parser function count: 1/500\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3931/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.059/10.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1032472/52428800 bytes\nNumber of Wikibase entities loaded: 0/500\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,te